# The story with another player character, continued (tester report 20261105-162033: "HUNK's sniper rifle scope
# drops down when aiming"). The first-person cameras (the rifle scope CameraScope, the binoculars CameraBinocular,
# the look down on an enemy StartLookDownEm) start at the middle of the player's eyes, parts 0x20 and 0x21. Leon,
# Ada, Krauser and Wesker have them at eye height (measured with Leon's rifle aimed, r103: 1640 above the feet);
# HUNK's model has no eyes there (0x20 sits at his chest, 1132, 0x21 at the root, -61): his scope looked from his
# hips. While HUNK stands in for Leon the cameras take the point where Leon's eyes sit in the head part 4 (the
# same bones for both, runtime/cheats.cpp re4_story_char_eyes). HUNK's own games have no such camera.
# Not a bug of the prototype: a port feature (the cheat menu, patch 0195). Without HUNK as a stand-in nothing
# changes.
--- a/src/game/cam_extra.cpp
